[node name="LeftTitle" parent="Pages/GrimoirePage4" index="5" unique_id=339167460]
text = "Element: Fire

Astrology: The Sun 
(celestial center of life, 
ego, consciousness, and 
vitality)"

[node name="LeftDescription" parent="Pages/GrimoirePage4" index="6" unique_id=1512466279]
text = "           Golden radiance, absolute clarity, and 
           triumphant success. The Sun brings 
           brilliant warmth, forcing the seeker to 
       see right through complex riddles with 
     childlike joy. It represents a peak era 
where everything the traveler touches bursts 
into glorious bloom."

[node name="RightTitle" parent="Pages/GrimoirePage4" index="7" unique_id=1071230051]
text = "Element: Fire

Astrology: Aries 
(leadership, pioneering 
spirit, and raw authority)
"

[node name="RightDescription" parent="Pages/GrimoirePage4" index="8" unique_id=275314100]
text = "Regal structure, stubborn stability, and the 
 weaving of protective boundaries. This card 
represents the rock-solid foundations required 
to build a lasting legacy. It calls upon the 
seeker to summon their inner discipline and 
  organize a chaotic environment into a 
well-regulated regime."

[node name="GrimoirePage5" parent="Pages" unique_id=1489096174 instance=ExtResource("3_46r2j")]
visible = false
layout_mode = 0
left_tooltip_text = "You must follow your finest wizarding intuition, trusting in all you have masterfully learned of the sacred arts of alchemy to guide the final flames."
right_tooltip_text = "???"
